---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ForgeExperience from '../../components/ForgeExperience.astro';
import PageBackdrop from '../../components/PageBackdrop.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="关于"
  description="关于老羊，以及微信公众号「老羊只是电子羊」。"
  active="about"
>
  <PageBackdrop
    slot="background"
    src="/images/cosmic/about-planet-horizon.webp"
    position="center right"
    mobilePosition="62% top"
    mobileOpacity={0.58}
    effect="planet"
  />
  <ForgeExperience returnLabel="返回关于我" worldLabel="老羊的铁匠铺" />
  <div class="page-shell" data-forge-background>
    <div class="reading about-page">
      <section>
        <div class="eyebrow">About Job Yang</div>
        <h1 class="display">关于我，<br />以及在这里写什么。</h1>
        <div class="copy">
          <p>我是老羊。资深 iOS 工程师，先后在美团、字节跳动做客户端，写了很多年移动端。最近在全面转向 AI，一边学它、一边用它重做自己的工具链。</p>
          <p>
            这里没什么宏大目标，主要就是记录：我读到的、想到的、以及踩过的坑。
          </p>
          <button
            class="forge-entry"
            type="button"
            data-forge-open
            aria-controls="forge-experience"
            aria-expanded="false"
          >
            <span>
              <strong>进入老羊的铁匠铺</strong>
              <small>3D INTERACTIVE SELF-INTRODUCTION</small>
            </span>
            <b aria-hidden="true">→</b>
          </button>
          <p>这个网站主要放两类内容：</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>文章：</strong>AI Agent、软件工程、iOS 与技术趋势的长期思考。</li>
            <li><strong>手记：</strong>还没到一篇文章体量的想法和话题引子，有些以后会展开成文。</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="profile-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/Job-Yang" rel="me">GitHub</a>
          <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="wechat" class="wechat section-rule">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Subscription</div>
          <h2 class="display">老羊只是电子羊</h2>
          <p>
            网站是可搜索、可长期引用的公开档案；微信公众号是订阅入口，会同步新文章和更及时的短分享。
          </p>
          <p>扫码关注，或搜索公众号「老羊只是电子羊」。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="qr-code">
          <img src="/images/wechat-qr.jpg" alt="微信公众号「老羊只是电子羊」二维码" width="180" height="180" />
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding: 90px 0 120px;
  }

  .about-page h1 {
    margin: 18px 0 42px;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 58px);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .copy {
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.82;
  }

  .copy p {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .copy strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .copy li {
    margin-bottom: 11px;
  }

  .profile-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 38px;
  }

  .profile-links a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .forge-entry {
    display: flex;
    width: min(100%, 420px);
    min-height: 76px;
    margin: 6px 0 30px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 185, 113, 0.34);
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.72);
    color: var(--ink);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    transition: border-color 180ms ease, background 180ms ease, transform 180ms ease;
  }

  .forge-entry:hover {
    border-color: rgba(245, 185, 113, 0.72);
    background: rgba(245, 185, 113, 0.09);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .forge-entry:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .forge-entry span {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .forge-entry strong {
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .forge-entry small {
    color: var(--accent);
    font: 9px var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
  }

  .forge-entry b {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .wechat {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 86px;
    padding-top: 62px;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 180px;
    gap: 52px;
  }

  .wechat h2 {
    margin: 14px 0 20px;
    font-size: 32px;
  }

  .wechat p {
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }

  .qr-code {
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .qr-code img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .about-page {
      padding-top: 64px;
    }

    .about-page h1 {
      font-size: 38px;
    }

    .wechat {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .forge-entry {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 74px;
    }
  }
</style>
